                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "Minimum errors include CONTEXT_OVERFLOW, REQUEST_TOO_LARGE, HARDWARE_VRAM_INSUFFICIENT, HARDWARE_CAPACITY_UNKNOWN, TOKENIZER_UNAVAILABLE, MODEL_BUSY_AND_QUEUE_FULL, MODEL_NOT_LOADED, MODEL_LOAD_FAILED, RUNTIME_CALL_FAILED, and REQUEST_CANCELLED."
                    },
                    {
